#: ../../source/production/kubernetes_deployment.rst:2
msgid "Kubernetes Deployment"
msgstr "Kubernetes 部署"

#: ../../source/production/kubernetes_deployment.rst:4
msgid ""
"For Kubernetes deployment of vLLM with LMCache integration, we recommend "
"using the `vLLM Production Stack <https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/production-stack>`_ project. This is a specialized production-ready "
"implementation for K8S-native cluster-wide deployment for vllm & lmcache."
msgstr ""
"对于 Kubernetes 部署 vLLM 与 LMCache 集成，我们推荐使用 `vLLM Production Stack "
"<https://github.com/vllm-project/production-stack>`_ 项目。这是一个专门为 K8S 原生集群范围部署"
" vllm 和 lmcache 而设计的生产就绪实现。"

#: ../../source/production/kubernetes_deployment.rst:6
msgid ""
"For a quick start guide, please refer to the official `documentation "
"<https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/production-"
"stack/en/latest/getting_started/quickstart.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"快速入门指南，请参考官方 `文档 <https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/production-"
"stack/en/latest/getting_started/quickstart.html>`_"

